        {
          "kind": "sentence",
          "label": "Sentences",
          "en": "His emerald green eyes sparkled impishly.",
          "page": 203,
          "id": "22-040",
          "zh": "他祖母绿般的双眼闪着顽皮的光。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "sentence",
          "label": "Sentences",
          "en": "Curly, ink-black eyelashes feathered her beautiful sapphire blue eyes.",
          "page": 203,
          "id": "22-041",
          "zh": "墨黑卷翘的睫毛像羽毛般衬着她美丽的蓝宝石色眼睛。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "sentence",
          "label": "Sentences",
          "en": "Her eyes were mud brown and as big as saucers.",
          "page": 203,
          "id": "22-042",
          "zh": "她的眼睛是泥棕色的，大得像茶碟。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "sentence",
          "label": "Sentences",
          "en": "Kitty’s eyes were like sparkling blue diamonds and always seemed to dance with laughter.",
          "page": 203,
          "id": "22-043",
          "zh": "基蒂的眼睛像闪亮的蓝钻，总像有笑意在其中跳动。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "sentence",
          "label": "Sentences",
          "en": "Her eyes were velvet-brown and beamed with warmth like candles in the dark.",
          "page": 203,
          "id": "22-044",
          "zh": "她天鹅绒般的棕色眼睛散发温暖的光，像黑暗中的蜡烛。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "sentence",
          "label": "Sentences",
          "en": "Robert’s mouth was set in a firm line, but his twinkling grey eyes lit up his face.",
          "page": 203,
          "id": "22-045",
          "zh": "罗伯特紧抿着嘴，但闪亮的灰眼睛使他的脸生动起来。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "sentence",
          "label": "Sentences",
          "en": "Eyes that were as black as coal peered at her from beneath curly black lashes.",
          "page": 203,
          "id": "22-046",
          "zh": "煤黑的双眼从卷曲的黑睫毛下望着她。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "sentence",
          "label": "Sentences",
          "en": "His steely blue eyes glinted like frost.",
          "page": 203,
          "id": "22-047",
          "zh": "他钢蓝色的眼睛闪着霜一般的冷光。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "sentence",
          "label": "Sentences",
          "en": "His large, staring eyes were an icy grey.",
          "page": 203,
          "id": "22-048",
          "zh": "他瞪大的双眼是冰冷的灰色。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "sentence",
          "label": "Sentences",
          "en": "His bright green eyes burned with a cruel light.",
          "page": 203,
          "id": "22-049",
          "zh": "他明亮的绿眼睛里燃着残酷的光。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "sentence",
          "label": "Sentences",
          "en": "Her eyes were an icy blue – cold and dangerous.",
          "page": 203,
          "id": "22-050",
          "zh": "她的眼睛是冰蓝色的，冷漠而危险。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "sentence",
          "label": "Sentences",
          "en": "His eyes were a slate grey and bulging like a frog.",
          "page": 203,
          "id": "22-051",
          "zh": "他的眼睛呈板岩灰色，像青蛙的眼睛一样突出。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "sentence",
          "label": "Sentences",
          "en": "His eyes were as black as coal and hidden beneath huge bushy eyebrows.",
          "page": 203,
          "id": "22-052",
          "zh": "他的眼睛像煤一样黑，藏在粗大浓密的眉毛下面。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "sentence",
          "label": "Sentences",
          "en": "His flinty, narrowed eyes were cold and rimmed with bulging blue veins.",
          "page": 203,
          "id": "22-053",
          "zh": "他眯起的双眼冷酷如燧石，四周凸起青色血管。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "sentence",
          "label": "Sentences",
          "en": "Like a hawk, her eyes were yellow and unblinking and took in every detail, every move.",
          "page": 203,
          "id": "22-054",
          "zh": "她的双眼像鹰眼一样黄而不眨，捕捉着每一个细节、每一个动作。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "sentence",
          "label": "Sentences",
          "en": "Her cold blue eyes were almost transparent and made Robert shiver as they drilled into him.",
          "page": 203,
          "id": "22-055",
          "zh": "她冰冷的蓝眼睛几乎透明，钻探般的注视使罗伯特打了个寒战。"
        }
      ]
    },
